5,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I’m worried about the person who has to chase the money. Last year, the treasurer looked exhausted.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We cannot set a fee without knowing the actual costs. Guesswork failed us last time.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"The club feels fragile. If the fee structure is confusing, people will drift away.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I’ve noticed people hesitating to come out. It feels like they’re calculating if it’s worth it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Some people are here every night, others never show. Is that fair? I want to know the numbers.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, if we don’t know the costs, how do we know what to charge?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Minato, exactly. I need to see the ledger to understand where the money actually goes.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@May, that hesitation is worrying. I want to see who is actually coming and who is leaving.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minako, I agree. I want to check the sign-in sheets to see the real turnout.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, the ledger is good, but I want to see the rota. Who is doing the work?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I’ll check the treasurer’s hours and the bank statements. I need to know the burden.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will examine the ledger and the bank statements. I need the hard numbers.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,I’ll look at the sign-in sheets and the taster forms. I need to see who is drifting.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I’ll check the weekday turnout and the winter social notes. I want to understand the mood.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll check the rota and the sign-in sheets. I need to see the imbalance.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
