60,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option A is the flat fee. It’s simple, but will it cover the fixed costs?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option A is predictable. Option B creates admin nightmares. Option C is complex but fair.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minako,,Option C allows people to choose. It respects the different levels of participation we see.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,Option A feels safest. I don’t want to lose the quiet members to a tiered system.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option C is the only one that addresses the imbalance. I’m voting for it.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, if Option A covers the fixed costs, it’s the best for the treasurer.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Minato, yes, but we must set the figure carefully. I vote for A to keep it simple.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@May, I understand your worry. But Option C gives people a voice. I vote for C.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,"@Minako, I’m still worried. But I’ll vote for A to keep the club inclusive.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minako, I agree. Option C is the only fair choice. I stand by my vote.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minato,,I vote for A. It’s the simplest and least burdensome for the treasurer.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I vote for A. It’s predictable and avoids the admin of activity-based charging.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minako,,I vote for C. It respects the different levels of participation and gives people a choice.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,I vote for A. I want to keep the club inclusive and avoid the exclusivity of tiers.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I vote for C. It’s the only way to address the imbalance fairly.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
